      "rule": "weight + residual_cover - 0.35*max(0,deleted_cover-residual_cover) - 0.2*neighbor_pack + 0.05*neighbor_edges/max(1e-9,abs(1+neighbor_mass)) + 0.02*residual_peak - 0.01*neighbor_mass",
      "rationale": "Compare retained and deletion-only cover estimates to penalize their drop under inclusion. Use neighborhood packing as a feasible exchange witness and retain a heavy residual alternative."
